<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CO" style="id">- Nyanja Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">1 Akolinso</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kalata yoyamba ya Poolo kwa Akoliso</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Akolinso</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Kol</para>
  <para style="mt">Kalata Yoyamba ya Poolo kwa Akolinso</para>
  <para style="mt">Akolinso</para>
  <para style="imt">Uchogolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Mtumwi Poolo nde uyo wadalemba chikalakala ichi cha Akolinso oyamba panyengo iwandikila chaka cha hamsini ni tano pambuyo pakubadwa Yesu muomboli nghope ya 1:1. Iyi nikalata yoyamba pakati paziwili izo zalembedwa ni Poolo kwa gulu la wandhu amkhulupilila Yesu yawo adali kumujhi wa Kolinso. Ikhozeka wadalemba kalata iyi yapo wamakhala ku Efeso wakali kupita ulendo uwo wamafuna kupita ku Kolinso, yapo siwajhipita ni kubwela kuchokela ku Makedonia Nghope ya 16:5-9.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kalata iyi ni yangho la Poolo kwa nghani izo wadazilandila kuchokela kwa okhulupilila akumojhi agulu lawandhu amkhulupilila Yesu, panghani ya vindhu vakumojhi sivimafunike vidachitika mu gulu lawandhu amkhulupilila Yesu, akakhala pamojhi ni kupatukana ni chigololo. Mujhi wa Kolinso udajhiwika kupunda ndande ya vichito vachigololo vidayenela, chimwecho siidabwicha kupenya gulu lawandhu amkhulupilila Yesu limachauchidwa ni vindhu vimenevo. Chikalakala cha 1 Akolinso chili ni nghope iyo ikambilila nghani ya chikondi nghope ya 13.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yayo yalimo mchikalakala ichi</para>
  <para style="io">Poolo wayamba kwa kwaalonjela Akolinso ni kuyamika Mnungu ndande ya anyiiwo nghope ya 1:1-9.</para>
  <para style="io">Pambuyo pake wachatilila nghani izo wadavela nghani za kupatukana mugulu lawandhu amkhulupilila Yesu la Akolinso nghope ya 1:10, 4:21.</para>
  <para style="io">Ndiipo wachatilila nghani ya chigololo ni vichito ivo amachitilana vakupelekana ku nyumba ya milandu achinawene nghope ya 5-6.</para>
  <para style="io">Pambuyo pake waakambila nghani ya ukwati, kupeleka njhembe kwa viboliboli, kulambila pa malo pokomanilana, mbhaso za Mknungu izo zichoka kwa Mnungu ni vindhu vanghani ya kuhyuka nghope ya 7-15.</para>
  <para style="io">Potela wamaliza kwa kufotokoza vindhu vakumojhi vochita, ni vamundhu mwene nghope ya 16.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 1:1" />Ine Poolo, uyonatanidwa ni Mnungu kukhala mtumwi wa Kilisito Yesu ngati Mnungu wafunila, nili pano ni mbale Sositene.<verse eid="1CO 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 1:2" />Kwa gulu la wandhu amkhulupilila Yesu ilo lali ku Kolinso, anyiimwe mwachitidwa kukhala wandhu a Mnungu, ndande mwalunjana ni Kilisito Yesu, mudatanidwa kukhala wandhu a Mnungu pamojhi ni onjhe kila pamalo paliponjhe waapembha Ambuye wathu Yesu Kilisito, Mbuye wao, ni Mbuye wathu.<verse eid="1CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 1:3" />Nikupembhelani Ubwino ni mtendele kuchoka kwa Mnungu Tate wathu ni Mbuye wathu Yesu Kilisito.<verse eid="1CO 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Poolo wamuyamika Mnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 1:4" />Niayamika Amnungu wanga siku zonjhe ndande ya Ubwino uwo akupachani kupitila Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 1:5" />Pa kulunjana ni Kilisito mwakhala ni mwayi kwa kila kandhu, yaani pakukamba konjhe ni njelu. <verse eid="1CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 1:6" />Uthenga wa Kilisito uwo mudakambidwa ni wauzene, <verse eid="1CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 1:7" />chimwecho simulepela kulandila mbhaso yaliyonjhe, yapo mulindilila kujha kwa Ambuye wathu Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 1:8" />Iye siwaendekele kupachani mbhavu pa kumtumikila Mnungu, ni palibe uyo siwakupacheni mlandu mbaka siku lothela yapo Mbuye wathu Yesu yapo siwabwele. <verse eid="1CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 1:9" />Mnungu ni okhulupilika, Mnungu adakusanghani anyiimwe mkhale ni umoyo pamojhi ni mwana wake Yesu Kilisito, Mbuye wathu.<verse eid="1CO 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupatukana kwa Wandhu amkhulupilila Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 1:10" />Kwa ulamulilo wa Ambuye wathu Yesu Kilisito nikupembhani kupunda, achabale wanga, mvanichane kwa kila chindhu icho mukamba, sikudakhala ni kupatukana pakati panu, mukhale ni maganizo yamojhi ni dala imojhi. <verse eid="1CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 1:11" />Ndande wandhu wina kuchokela mnyumba ya Kiloe, anikambila, kuti yao mwamkhulupilila Yesu palibe mvano pakati panu. <verse eid="1CO 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 1:12" />Nikamba chimwechi, “Kila mmojhi pakati panu wakamba chake, mmojhi wakamba, ‘Ine nimchata Poolo,’ mwina, ‘Ine nimchata Apolo,’ mwina, ‘Ine nimchata Petulo,’ ni mwina, ‘Ine nimchata Kilisito.’” <verse eid="1CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 1:13" />Bwanji, Kilisito wadajhipatula magulumagulu? Bwanji, Poolo nde uyo wadapachikidwa pa mtanda ndande yanu? Bwanji mudabatizidwa ngati oyaluzidwa a Poolo?<verse eid="1CO 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 1:14" />Naayamika Amnungu pakuti sinidambatize waliyonjhe pakati panu, nambho Kilisipo ni Gayo pe. <verse eid="1CO 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 1:15" />Chimwecho palibe uyo wakhoza kukambi wabatizidwa kuti wakhale oyaluzidwa wanga. <verse eid="1CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 1:16" />Nakumbukila, nidambatiza Sitefano ni wandhu amnyumba mwake, nambho sinikumbukila ngati nidambatiza mundhu mwina waliyonjhe. <verse eid="1CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 1:17" />Kilisito siwadanitume kubatiza. Wanituma kulalikila Uthenga Wabwino, nilalikile popande kukhulupilila mawu ya hekima za wandhu, dala mbhavu ya nyifa ya Kilisito pamtanda siidaoneka yopandemate.<verse eid="1CO 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kilisito ni mbhavu ni hekima ya Amnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 1:18" />Nghani ya nyifa ya Kilisito pamtanda ni chindhu chopande mate kwa anyiyawo asowa, nambho kwaife taomboledwa iyi ni mbhavu ya Mnungu. <verse eid="1CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 1:19" />Pakuti Malembo ya Mnungu yakamba chimwechi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 1:19">“Siniziwanange hekima za anyiyawo ali ni hekima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 1:19">ni njelu zawo anyiyawo asoma siwazichite kuti zilibemate.”<verse eid="1CO 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 1:20" />Chimwecho walikuti uyo wali ni hekima? Walikuti oyaluza thauko? Walikuti wakhoza kuchuchana pa jhiko lino? Mnungu wailangiza hekima ya jhiko lino kukhala yopande mate.<verse eid="1CO 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 1:21" />Mnungu ni wa hekima, wandhu sakhoza kumjhiwa Mnungu kwa kukhulupilila hekima yao achinawene. Chimwecho Mnungu wadautumila uthenga wa Yesu Kilisito uwo uoneka kuti ulibe mate, nambho anyiwajha aukhulupilila uthenga umenewo aomboledwa. <verse eid="1CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 1:22" />Ayahudi afuna vizindikilo dala akhulupilile, ni Agiliki afuna hekima. <verse eid="1CO 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 1:23" />Nambho ife timlalikila Kilisito uyo wadapachikidwa, kwa Ayahudi chindhu ichi ni choipicha, ni kwa Agiliki chopande mate. <verse eid="1CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 1:24" />Nambho kwa anyiyawo atanidwa ni Mnungu Ayahudi kwa Agiliki, Kilisito uyu wadapachikidwa ni mbhavu ya Mnungu ni hekima ya Mnungu. <verse eid="1CO 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 1:25" />Pakuti icho chioneka kuti usabwabwa wa Mnungu, ni hekima yopitilila hekima ya mundhu, ni kufooka kwa Mnungu, ni mbhavu kupitilila mbhavu ya mundhu.<verse eid="1CO 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 1:26" />Chipano okhulupila Yesu anjanga mganizile nghani iyi kuti Mnungu wadakutanani ili mukhale wake. Kwa maganizo ya wandhu mdaoneka kuti ambili wanu mulibe hekima wandhu ambili adalibe mbhavu kapina wandhu acheo chachikulu. <verse eid="1CO 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 1:27" />Nambho Mnungu wadasangha yao oneka usabwabwa kwa jhiko, dala wavipache mwano yavo vili ni hekima, Mnungu wadasangha ofooka a jhiko dala walengeche mwano yawo ali ni mbhavu. <verse eid="1CO 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 1:28" />Mnungu wadasangha wandhu ofooka a jhiko lino ni yawo adeleledwa, dala walengeche mwano wandhu yawo ali ni mbhavu. <verse eid="1CO 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 1:29" />Ichi mateyake wali ni thupi waliyonjhe siwadajhi elekela pachogolo pa Mnungu. <verse eid="1CO 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 1:30" />Nambho Mnungu wakulunjani ni Kilisito Yesu, ni Mnungu wamchita Kilisito wakhale hekima yathu. Kwa kupitila Yesu tali ovomelezeka, ni tikhala wandhu Mnungu ni anyiyao taomboledwa. <verse eid="1CO 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 1:31" />Chimwecho ngati umo yakambila malembo ya Mnungu, “Iye wajhi elekela wajhielekele mwa Mbuye.”<verse eid="1CO 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CO 2" />
  <para style="s">Uthenga wa Kilisito uyo wadapachikidwa pamtanda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 2:1" />Achabale, paja nidajha kwanu, sinidajhe kukulalikilani Uthenga wa Mnungu kwa kukwanila, kapina kwa hekima ya wandhu. <verse eid="1CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 2:2" />Pajha nidali namwe, nidachita maganizo yanga yaiwalile kila kandhu ila Yesu Kilisito yokha ni nyifa yake pa mtanda. <verse eid="1CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 2:3" />Pajha nidajha kwanu, nidali ofooka ni wamandha ni kutendhemela kupunda, <verse eid="1CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 2:4" />ni mayaluzo yanga ni uthenga wanga siudali wa mau ya kwa kwadilicha wandhu, nambho kwa mbhavu ya Mzimu wa Mnungu. <verse eid="1CO 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 2:5" />Dala chikhulupi chanu chisakhala mu hekima ya wandhu nambho mu mbhavu za Mnungu.<verse eid="1CO 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hekima za Mnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 2:6" />Nambho tidakamba kwa hekima kwa wandhu akwanila mumzimu wa Mnungu, nambho osati hekima ya jhiko lino, kapina ya anyiyao alamula jhiko lino, anyiyao ulamulilo uli mgulu lotayika. <verse eid="1CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 2:7" />Hekima iyo niuzila ni uthenga wa uzene wa Mnungu ijha idabisika kwa wandhu mbaka saazino, iyi Mnungu wadaisangha kwa ulemelelo wathu kuyambila mmayambo. <verse eid="1CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 2:8" />Palibe mlamuli wa jhiko lino waijhiwa hekima iyi. Ngati adakaijhiwa, saadakapachika pamtanda Ambuye aulemelelo. <verse eid="1CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 2:9" />Atangati malembo ya Mnungu yalembedwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">“Chijha mundhu siwadachione kapina mundhu kuchivela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">vindhu ivo mundhu siwadaviganizilepo kuti vichokele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">ivi nde ivo Mnungu wakonjela onjhe amkonda iye.”<verse eid="1CO 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 2:10" />Nambho Mnungu watilangiza kupitila Mzimu wake. Mzimu upenyecha kila chindhu, ata vachisisi vamkati mwa Mnungu. <verse eid="1CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 2:11" />Palibe mundhu uyo wajhiwa maganizo ya mundhu mwina. Chimchijha mzimu wokha ulimkati nde ujhiwa maganizo ya mundhu mmeneyo, chimwecho ndeumo ili ata kwa Mnungu, Mzimu wokha wa Mnungu nde ujhiwa maganizo ya Mnungu. <verse eid="1CO 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 2:12" />Sitidalandile Mzimu wa jhiko nambho ife talandila Mzimu ujha wachokela kwa Mnungu, chimwecho sitijhiwe vonjhe ivo Mnungu watipacha ife.<verse eid="1CO 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 2:13" />Chimwecho sitikamba kwa mau ayaluza ali ni hekima, nambho mau wa yaluza Mzimu wa Mnungu, tikambilila vindhu va Uzimu kwa onjhe ali ni Mzimu wa Mnungu. <verse eid="1CO 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 2:14" />Uyo walibe Mzimu wa Mnungu siwakhoza kulandila mbhaso ikujha kuchokela kwa Mzimu wa Mnungu. Mundhu mmeneyo siwakhoza kuva yameneyo, waona kuti vindhu vimenevo vilibe mate, ndande yake yavunukulidwa muchizimu. <verse eid="1CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 2:15" />Uyo wali ni Mzimu wa Mnungu, wakhoza kulamula ngati umo ifunika, nambho siwakhoza kulamulidwa ni wandhu wina. <verse eid="1CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 2:16" />Ngati umo yalembedwa mmalembo ya Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:16">“Yani wajhiwa maganizo ya Mbuye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:16">Yani wakhoza kumkambila Mnungu chindhu chochita?”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CO 2:16">Nambho ife tili ni maganizo ngati Kilisito.<verse eid="1CO 2:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CO 3" />
  <para style="s">Atumiki Amnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 3:1" />Abale wanga, yapo nidali kwanu sinidakhoze kukuyaluzani anyiimwe ngati umo nayaluzila wandhu ali ni mzimu wa Mnungu, nidafunika kukuyaluzani nianyimwe ngati wandhu muli ajhiko lino, mdali ngati wana waang'ono yawo simdakhoze kujhiwa bwino chikhulupi cha Kikilisito. <verse eid="1CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 3:2" />Nidakuyaluzani vindhu vopepuka ngati mujha maye wammwecha mwana wake likama, osati chakudya cholimba, nidachita chimwechi ndande simudali tayali kwachakudya cholimba. Ni ata chipano simuli tayali, <verse eid="1CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 3:3" />ndande muyendekela kukhala ngati umo wandhu ajhiko lino akhalila. Ngati muli ni njhanje pakati panu ni muli ni ndewo ni mwina, ili lichimikiza kuti muli ajhiko lino, bwanji mukhala bwino? <verse eid="1CO 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 3:4" />Akumojhi wanu akamba, “Timchata Poolo,” ni wina, “Timchata Apolo” bwanji anyiimwe namwe muchita ngati wandhu ajhiko?<verse eid="1CO 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 3:5" />Bwanji, Apolo ni yani? Ni Poolo ni yani? Ife niatumikipe anyiyao a Mnungu adatitumila dala mumkhulupilile Yesu Kilisito. Kila mmojhi wathu wadachita njhito iyo wapachidwa ni Mbuye. <verse eid="1CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 3:6" />Ine nidavyala mbeu, Apolo wadamwazilila majhi, nambho Mnungu nde uyo wadachita ikule. <verse eid="1CO 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 3:7" />Chimwecho uyo wavyala mbeu ni uyo wamwazilila majhi sio kandhu. Nambho Mnungu yokha nde wamate uyo waichita ikule. <verse eid="1CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 3:8" />Palibe kusiyana pakati pa yujha wavyala ni wamwazilila majhi, Mnungu siwampache kila mundhu mbhaso yake kuchokana ni njhito iyo wachita. <verse eid="1CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 3:9" />Pakuti ife tichita njhito ya Mnungu pamojhi, ni anyiimwe nimunda wa Mnungu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 3:9">Anyiimwe ni nyumba ya Mnungu. <verse eid="1CO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 3:10" />Kwa tandizo la ubwino wa Mnungu wanipacha ine, kukhala woyamba kukulalikilani anyiimwe uthenga wa Mnungu, ngati mujha fundi wakhoza kumanga nyumba yapo wayamba kumanga nyumba, ni mafundi wina akujha kumanga pamwamba pake. Nambo kila mmojhi wanu wakhale maso umo wamangila pamwamba pake. <verse eid="1CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 3:11" />Palibe mundhu mwina wapeleka mayaluzo yina pakuti mayaluzo yameneyo tayali yalipo nde Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 3:12" />Oyaluza yawo ayaluza bwino mayaluzo ya Yesu yali ngati omanga yao amanga nyumba kwa kutumila zahabu, madini, ni myala ya mtengo wa ukulu nambho oyaluza yawo sayaluza bwino ali ngati omanga yawo amanga atumila mitengo, machamba au maujhu. <verse eid="1CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 3:13" />Pakuti siku limenelo kila njhito ya wandhu sidajhiwike umo ili, siku limenelo silijhe ni moto ni moto umenewo siupime kila njhito, ni moto siudaiyese njhito ni kuilangiza mtundu wake. <verse eid="1CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 3:14" />Ikakhala njhito ya mundhu ngati siiyomwa pamoto, siwalandile mbhaso. <verse eid="1CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 3:15" />Nambho ngati njhito ya mundhu siiyomwe pamoto, siwapata mbhaso, nambho iye mwene siwalamichidwe ngati mujha wachelembuka pa moto.<verse eid="1CO 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 3:16" />Zene mjhiwa kuti anyimwe ni nyumba ya Mnungu ni kuti Mzimu wa Mnungu ukhala mkati mwanu? <verse eid="1CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 3:17" />Mnungu siwamuwanange waliyonjhe uyo wawananga nyumba ya Mnungu, pakuti nyumba ya Mnungu ni yoyela kupunda, ni nyumba imeneyo nimwachina wene.<verse eid="1CO 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 3:18" />Msadajhinamiza, ngati mwina wanu wakajhiganiza waima pa jhiko, wafunika wakhale owowela kuti wapate kukhala ni hekima. <verse eid="1CO 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 3:19" />Hekima ya wandhu a jhiko lino ni usabwabwa pachogolo pa Mnungu, ngati umo malembo Mnungu yalembedwa, “Mnungu wakodwecha ahekima pakuchenjela kwao,” <verse eid="1CO 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 3:20" />Yalembedwa chimwechi mmalembo yina, “Mbuye wajhiwa maganizo ya ahekima asati ya bwino.” <verse eid="1CO 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 3:21" />Chimwecho mundhu wasajhidamila ivo wandhu avichita, ndande vindhu vonjhe vanu. <verse eid="1CO 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 3:22" />Poolo, Apolo, ni Petulo, jhiko lino, umoyo kapina nyifa, vindhu vachipano ni vapambuyo, ivi vonjhe ni vanu, <verse eid="1CO 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 3:23" />ni anyiimwe ni wandhu wake Kilisito, ni Kilisito ni wa Mnungu.<verse eid="1CO 3:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CO 4" />
  <para style="s">Atumwi a Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 4:1" />Mnungu watituma ife tikakambile wandhu wake uthenga uwo wandhu siwadakambilepo wandhu, taikidwa kukhala oyimilila nghani za chikhulupi cha Mnungu. <verse eid="1CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 4:2" />Chifunika kwa mtumiki ni kukhala wokhulupilila. <verse eid="1CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 4:3" />Nambho kwanga siyo kandhu kuti nilamulidwe ni anyimwe, kapina nyumba za milandu, ngati nachita njhito bwino kapina osati bwino, nambho sinijhilamula namwene. <verse eid="1CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 4:4" />Pakuti sinijhiwa ngati nachita chindhu choipa, nambho siilangiza kuti ine nilibe mlandu, nambho yao anilamula ine ni Ambuye. <verse eid="1CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 4:5" />Chimwecho, msadamlamula mundhu walionjhe ndhawi yake ikali osafike, lindani mbaka yapo Ambuye siwajhe. Iye siwayaike pa dangalila yayo yadabisidwa kumdima, ni kuika padangalila yayo yali mumtima mwa wandhu. Ndhawi imeneyo kila mmojhi siwalandile matamando kuchokela kwa Mnungu.<verse eid="1CO 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 4:6" />Achabale wanga, vindhu vimenevo navichita kukhala chifani cha ine ni Apolo dala yakuthangatileni, dala kwa chifani chathu, “Kuyavela nikuyachita yayo yalembedwa.” Mmojhi wanu wasadajhi dama ni kumdelela njake. <verse eid="1CO 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 4:7" />Yani wakuchita ukhale wamkulu kupitilila m wina, bwanji Mnungu siwadakupache kilakandhu icho ulinacho? Chabwino, ngati udalandila ujhidama chiyani?<verse eid="1CO 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 4:8" />Bwanji, mwathokhala nikila kandhu yako mufuna? Mwathokhala opata? Mwathokhala mafumu, chabwino, idakakhala bwino ngati mudakhala mafumu ili nafe tikhale mafumu pamojhi namwe. <verse eid="1CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 4:9" />Niganiza kuti Mnungu watichocha ife atumwi mmathelo, ngati wandhu yawo alangidwa kuphedwa pa ndhandala, ndande takhala chosekechela kwa wandhu wonjhe, kwa atumiki a Mnungu akumwamba ni wandhu. <verse eid="1CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 4:10" />Ife tionekana ngati masabwabwa ndande ya kumtumikila Kilisito, nambho anyiimwe nianjelu mwa Kilisito, ife ofooka, nambho anyiimwe muli nimbhavu, ulemelelo, nambho ife sitipata ulemu. <verse eid="1CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 4:11" />Ata ndhawi ino, tili ni njala ni lujho, tilibe njhalu, tibulidwa, nitilibe pokhala, <verse eid="1CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 4:12" />ndiipo tijhivuticha kupota njhito kwa manja yathu. Akatitukana taachitila vabwino, akatikwiicha talekelela, <verse eid="1CO 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 4:13" />akatitukwana, ifetayangha kwa mau yabwino, nitichichidwa ngati wandhu wopande mate pano pajhiko.<verse eid="1CO 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 4:14" />Nilemba yaya osati ndande ya kukulengechani njhoni, nambho ndande ya kukuyaluzani ngati wana yawo nikukondani. <verse eid="1CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 4:15" />Ata ngati muli ni oyaluza khumi elfu mwa Kilisito, nambho muli ni atate amojhi. Pakuti ine nde navomela mwa Kilisito Yesu, kukupelekelani Uthenga Wabwino. <verse eid="1CO 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 4:16" />Chimwecho, nikupembhani mchate chifano changa. <verse eid="1CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 4:17" />Nde ndande namtuma Timoseo kwanu, mwana uyo nimkonda, okhulupilika pakulunjana ni Ambuye, uyo siwakumbuche njila niichata pa kulunjana ni Kilisito, ngati mujha niyaluzila kila pamalo pa kila gulu lawandhu lamkhulupila Yesu.<verse eid="1CO 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 4:18" />Wina ayamba kukhala ambuli aganiza ngati sinijha kukuyendelani. <verse eid="1CO 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 4:19" />Ngati Ambuye akaniloleza, sinijhe kwanu msanga, nane sinijhiwe, osati mau laope anyiyawo ambuli, ila mbhavu zao. <verse eid="1CO 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 4:20" />Pakuti Ufumu wa Mnungu siukhala mmau, nambho kukhala ni mbhavu za Mnungu. <verse eid="1CO 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 4:21" />Anyiimwe msangha chiyani? Nijhe kwanu ni mkhwapulo, kapina nijhe mu chikondi ni mtima ofacha?<verse eid="1CO 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CO 5" />
  <para style="s">Chigololo chiwananga gulu lamkhulupilila Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 5:1" />Navela kuti kwanu kuli chigololo, ni chigololo icho sichidakhalepo ata kwa wandhu yao siamjhiwa Mnungu, nakambilidwa pakati panu mmojhi wakhala ni wamkazi wa atate wake. <verse eid="1CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 5:2" />Namwe mujhidama, bwanji ata simudandaula, nikumchocha pakati panu mmeneyo wachita chigololo chimenecho. <verse eid="1CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 5:3" />Atangati sinili pamojhi nianyiimwe pamenepo panu, nambho nikhala naanyiimwe mu mzimu, ine natho mlamula mundhu uyu wachita chigololo ngati nidaka khalapo. <verse eid="1CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 5:4" />Mate yake, zene yapomsonghanika kumlambila Ambuye wathu Yesu nane nikhalapo pamojhi namwe mu mzimu ni kukhoza kwa Ambuye Yesu ukakhalapo. <verse eid="1CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 5:5" />Mpacheni mdani wa Mnungu mundhu mmeneyo dala walibule thupi lake dala wamchite mumndhu mmeneyo wasiye machimo yake, dala mzimu ulamichidwe pa siku la Ambuye.<verse eid="1CO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 5:6" />Kujhidama kwanu osati kwabwino, simujhiwa mkambo ukamba, “Amila yochepa itutumucha ufa onjhe wangano.” <verse eid="1CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 5:7" />Ndiipo, mkachoche amila ijha ya kale ya machimo, mkhale achipano. Ngati mujha mudali mkali asatilidwe amila. Mate yake Pasaka wathu, watho chochedwa kukhala njhembe, yaani Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 5:8" />Chimwecho tichite pwando la Pasaka, nambho osati kwa mabumunda ya kale ya amila ya machimo ni voipa, nambho tidye bumunda ilo lilibe amila, bumunda la uzene ni amila yabwino.<verse eid="1CO 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 5:9" />Nidakulembelani mu kalata yanga kuti msadagwilizana ni wandhu achigololo. <verse eid="1CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 5:10" />Sinikamba msadasinghizikana ni achigololo, kapina okhumbila, anghungu, kapina alambila viboliboli. Pakuti idakafunika kuchoka mujhiko lino. <verse eid="1CO 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 5:11" />Nambho chipano vindhu umovili nidakulembelani msadasinghizikana ni mundhu wakhulupilila ngati waendekela kuchita machimo, okhumbila, niuyo walambila viboliboli, kapina otukwana kapina olojhela, kapina olanda, mundhu wa mtundu uwu simdavomela ata kudya nayo.<verse eid="1CO 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 5:12" />Ili ni mate yanji kwalamula anyiwajha ali kubwalo? Achameneo Mnungu siwalamule. Nambho anyiimwe mufunika kulamula gulu lawandhu amkhulupilia Yesu, ngati umo malembo ya Mnungu yalembedwa, “Chocha wandhu oipa pakati panu.” <verse eid="1CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 5:13" />Mnungu siwalamule anyiwajha ali kubwalo. Bwanji, anyiimwe simufuna kwalamula anyiyao ali mugulu la wandhu amkhulupilila Yesu? Ngati umo malembo ya Mnungu yalembedwa, “Chocha mundhu oipa pakati panu.”<verse eid="1CO 5:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CO 6" />
  <para style="s">Milandu pakati pa amkhulipilila Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 6:1" />Ngati mmojhi wanu wali ni mlandu ni mnjake, mpita bwanji kumpacha mlandu kwa wandhu samjhiwa Mnungu, pamalo pa kumpacha mlandu pachogolo pa wandhu amjhiwa Mnungu? <verse eid="1CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 6:2" />Bwanji simujhiwa kuti wandhu a Mnungu sialamule wandhu siamjhiwa Mnungu? Ikakhala wandhu yawo siamjhiwa Mnungu sialamulidwe ni anyiimwe, ndande yanji simudalamulila ata vindhu vaving'ono? <verse eid="1CO 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 6:3" />Bwanji mujhiwa kuti sitaalamule niatumiki a kumwamba a Mnungu? Bwanji yaya siyadapitilile umo tikhalila pajhiko! <verse eid="1CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 6:4" />Yapo kukhala ni nghani pamwamba pa vindhu vakawaida, bwanji mwatana akahale alamuli wandhu anyiyao sialilemekeza gulu lawandhu amkhulupilila Yesu? <verse eid="1CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 6:5" />Nikamba chimwechi ndande yake muone njhoni, bwanji zene kuti palibe ata mmojhi pakati panu uyo wali ni hekima kuti watataule vuto pakati pa abale amkhulupila Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 6:6" />Pambuyo pake, mundhu mmojhi waokhulupilila Yesu wapeleka mlandu wandhu akhulupilila Yesu anjanu kwa anyiyao sadakhulupilile kulamula mlandu!<verse eid="1CO 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 6:7" />Kumeneko kukhala ni milandu pakati panu mwachinawene kulangiza mwalepela. Ndande yanjhi simdakavomela kuchitilidwa voipa, simbasa mvomele kulandidwa chuma chanu? <verse eid="1CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 6:8" />Pambuyo pake, mwachina wene nde mulanda ni kunyenga, ni yameneyo mwachitila anjanu yawo amkhulupilila Yesu! <verse eid="1CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 6:9" />Zene mujhiwa kuti anyiyawo achita voipa siapata ufumu wa Mnungu. Simdanyengeka Achigololo, kapina alambila viboliboli kapina akomana chithupi kumbuyo kwa maumbidwe, <verse eid="1CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 6:10" />kapina anghungu, kapina akhumbila kuipa, kapina alojhela, kapina otukwana, kapina alanda anyiyawa siaupata Ufumu wa Mnungu. <verse eid="1CO 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 6:11" />Akumojhi wanu adali amtundu umeneo. Nambho mudachukidwa ni mdakhala bwino kwa kuchochedwa machimo ni Mnungu, mwavomelezeka ni Mnungu kwa Ambuye Yesu Kilisito ni kwa Mzimu wa a Mnungu wathu.<verse eid="1CO 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tumilani Mathupi yanu kwa ulemelelo wa Mnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 6:12" />Mundhu siwakhoze kukamba, “Navomelezedwa kuchita chindhu chilichonjhe.” Yetu, nambho osati kila vindhu vali vabwino kwaiwe. Nikhoza kukamba navomelezedwa kuchita chindhu chilichonjhe, nambho sinifuna kulamulidwa ni chindhu chalichonjhe. <verse eid="1CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 6:13" />Ukhoza kukamba, “Chakudya ndande ya mimba, ni mimba ndande ya chakudya.” Yetu, nambho Mnungu siwaviwanange vonjhe. Thupi osati ndande ya chigololo, nambho kwa kwaatumikila Ambuye, ni Ambuye ayasunga mathupi yathu ni kuyapacha chakudya. <verse eid="1CO 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 6:14" />Mnungu wadahyukicha Ambuye Yesu, ni siwatihyukichenjho ife kwa mbhavu zake.<verse eid="1CO 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 6:15" />Mujhiwa kuti mathupi yanu ni viwalo va thupi la Kilisito. Mukhoza kutenga chiwalo cha thupi la Kilisito ni kuchichita malo ya thupi la hule? Siikhozeka! <verse eid="1CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 6:16" />Pakuti uyo walunjana ni hule wakhala thupi limojhi ni huleyo yalembedwa mmalembo ya Mnungu, “Nao awili akhala thupi limojhi.” <verse eid="1CO 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 6:17" />Nambho iye walunjana ni Ambuye wakhala mzimu umojhi ni Ambuye.<verse eid="1CO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 6:18" />Chithaweni chigololo. Machimo yina yonjhe wachita mundhu wachita kubwalo kwa thupi lake, nambho mundhu uyo wachita chigololo wachita mkhati mwathupi lake mwene wake. <verse eid="1CO 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 6:19" />Simujhiwa kuti mathupi yanu ni nyumba ya Mzimu Wamnungu, uwo ukhala mkati mwanu ni uwo mwapachidwa ni Mnungu? Mathupi yanu osati yanu mwachinawene nambho ni ya Mnungu, <verse eid="1CO 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 6:20" />pakuti mdaghulidwa kwa mtengo wa ukulu. Tumilani matupi yanu kwa ulemelelo wa Mnungu.<verse eid="1CO 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CO 7" />
  <para style="s">Mayaluzo ya nghani ya Ukwati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 7:1" />Chipano, kuchokana ni zijha nghani mdalemba.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 7:1">Anyiimwe mdafunjha kuti ni mbasa wammuna siwadakwata. <verse eid="1CO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 7:2" />Nambho chimo la chigololo ni loyipa, chimwecho kila wammuna wakhale ni wamkazi wake, ni kila wamkazi wakhale ni wammuna wake. <verse eid="1CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 7:3" />Wammuna wachite umo ifunikila kwa mkazake, ni wamkazi wachite umo ifunikila kwa mmunake, ni kila mmojhi wamkwaniliche mnjake icho chifunika. <verse eid="1CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 7:4" />Wamkazi walibe lamulo pamwamba pa thupi lake, nambho mmunake wali nilamulo pamwamba pa thupi la mkazake, chinchijha wammuna nayonjho walibe lamulo pamwamba pathupi lake, nambho mkazake wali nilamulo pa mwamba pathupi la mmunake. <verse eid="1CO 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 7:5" />Msadamanana nambho ikakhala mwavomelezana dala mpheze ndhawi ya mapembhelo, ndiipo mbwelelenjho ili Mdani wa Mnungu siwadapheza kukuikani mmayeso ndande ya kulepela kuchekeleza mafuno yanu.<verse eid="1CO 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 7:6" />Nikamba yaya kukupachani maganizo osati lamulo. <verse eid="1CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 7:7" />Ila nikonda wandhu onjhe akhale ngati ine umo nili, nambho kila mmojhi wali ni mbhaso yake kuchoka kwa Mnungu, mundhu mmojhi mbhaso iyi, ni mwina mbhaso ijha.<verse eid="1CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 7:8" />Chipano nikukambilani anyiimwe simuda kwate, nimwafedwa ni achamunanu, mbasa muendekele kukhala popande kukwata ni kukwatiwa ngati umo nili ine. <verse eid="1CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 7:9" />Nambho ngati simukhoza kuchekeleza makhumbilo yanu, chimwecho mkwate kapina kukwatiwa, pakuti mbasa kukwata kapina kukwatiwa kusiyana nikuhla ni kukhumbila.<verse eid="1CO 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 7:10" />Nambho kwa anyiwajha akwata nili ni lamulo. Wamkazi siwadasiyana ni mmunake, <verse eid="1CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 7:11" />nambho ikakhala wamkazi wasiyana nimmunake, siwada kwatiwa, kapina wabwelelane ni mmunake, ni wammuna siwadalemba kalata ya kumsiya mkazake.<verse eid="1CO 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 7:12" />Nambho kwa wina, ine nikukambilani osati Ambuye akamba, ngati wammuna wali ni wamkazi, siwada khulupilile, ni wamkazi wavomela kukhala nayo siwadamsiya. <verse eid="1CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 7:13" />Wamkazi uyo wamkhulupilila Kilisito, ngati wali ni wammuna uyo siwadakhulupilile, niwammuna mmeneyo wavomela kukhala nayo siwadamsiya. <verse eid="1CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 7:14" />Kwa wammuna siwadakhulupile walandilidwa kwa Mnungu kwa kulunjana ni mkazake, ni wamkazi siwada khulupilile walandilidwa ni Mnungu kwa kulunjana ni wammuna wamkhulupilila Kilisito. Ngati siidakali chimwecho wana wanu sadakavomelezedwa ni Mnungu, kumbe chipano avomelezedwa kukhala wana a Mnungu. <verse eid="1CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 7:15" />Nambho, wammuna kapina wamkazi siwadakhulupile wafuna kumsiya mnjake uyo wakhulupilila, chimwecho wachite chimwecho. Pakuchita chimwecho, wamkazi kapina wammuna wakhulupila siwamangika ndande Mnungu watitana tikhale ni umoyo wa mtendele. <verse eid="1CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 7:16" />Iwe wamkazi wamkhulupilila Yesu ujhiwa bwanji, ngati siumuombola mmunako? Kapina iwe wammuna ujhiwa bwanji ngati siumuombola mkazako?<verse eid="1CO 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mjhikhala ngati umo wakutanilani Mnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 7:17" />Nambho kila mmojhi wajhikhala ngati umo walamulidwa ni Ambuye, ngati umo watanidwila ni Mnungu. Ili ni lamulo ilo niyaluza mu magulu yonjhe ya yao amkhulupilila Yesu. <verse eid="1CO 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 7:18" />Ngati, mundhu wadatanidwa wathochitidwa mdulidwe, wasadajhichita kuti siwadadulidwe, ni ngati yapo wadatanidwa siwadadulidwe basi siwadadulidwa. <verse eid="1CO 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 7:19" />Kuchitidwa mdulidwe osati kandhu, nikukhala osachitidwe mdulidwe osati kandhu, nambho kuvela nikuyachata malamulo ya Mnungu. <verse eid="1CO 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 7:20" />Kila mmojhi wajhikhala ngati mujha Mnungu wadamtana. <verse eid="1CO 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 7:21" />Bwanji udatanidwa uli kapolo? Usadaona kuipa, ngati ukaona ufulu tumila malo ulinayo chipano, kusiyana ni nyengo ina yaliyonjhe. <verse eid="1CO 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 7:22" />Kwa kapolo watanidwa ni Ambuye iye wakhala mundhu wa ufulu, chimwecho watanidwa wali mundhu wa ufulu iye wakhala kapolo wa Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 7:23" />Mnungu wakughulani kwa mtengo waukulu, kuti msadakhala kapolo a wandhu. <verse eid="1CO 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 7:24" />Abale wanga kilammojhi wakhale ni pachogolo pa Mnungu ngati mujha wadali yapo wadatanidwa.<verse eid="1CO 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwa siadakwate ni afedwa ni wachimuna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 7:25" />Chipano kuchokana ni yajha mwalemba ya wandhu siadakwatiwe, nilibe lamulo kuchokela kwa Ambuye, nambho ine nichocha ganizo ine uyo kwa lisungu la Ambuye nifuni kuaminidwa. <verse eid="1CO 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 7:26" />Kuchokana ni vuto ilo lilipo chipano, niona mbasa mkhale ngati umo muli. <verse eid="1CO 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 7:27" />Bwanji wakwata? Chimwecho usada funa kusiyana ni mkazako. Bwanji siudakwate? Usada funa wamkazi. <verse eid="1CO 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 7:28" />Nambho ngati siukwate, siuchita machimo, ningati wamkazi siwada kwatiwe waka kwatiwa siwachita machimo. Nambho anyiyao akwatana siapheze masauko mu umoyo uwu, nane nifuna simuda pitila masauko yameneyo.<verse eid="1CO 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 7:29" />Abale wanga mateyake ndhawi ya khalila ni yochepa, kuyamba sazino anyiyao akwata akhale ngati siadakwate, <verse eid="1CO 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 7:30" />anyiyao ali mzaya, akhale ngati anyiyao siali mzaya, nianyiyao akondwela akhale ngati sakondwela, nianyiyao agula akhale ngati alibe cho ghula, <verse eid="1CO 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 7:31" />Wajha ajhichaucha ni vindhu va jhiko lino, akhale ngati alibenavo njhito. Pakuti pa jhiko lino silikhalila ndhawi yambili.<verse eid="1CO 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 7:32" />Nidakakonda anyiimwe msamakhaikila. Mundhu uyo walibe wamkazi wapota njhito ya Ambuye, ni ndande wafuna kumkondwelecha Ambuye. <verse eid="1CO 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 7:33" />Nambho wammuna uyo wakwata wapota njhito pavindhu va jhiko dala wamkondweleche mkazake, <verse eid="1CO 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 7:34" />ni waguzidwa kawili. Wammkazi siwada kwatiwe wajhi vuticha ni vindhu va Ambuye, nambho wammkazi wakwatiwa wajhichaucha ni vindhu va jhiko lino kuti wamkondweleche mmunake.<verse eid="1CO 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 7:35" />Nikamba yaya ndande nifuna kukutangatilani. Nifuna mkhale ni mpango uwo ufunika kuti mkhoze kwatumikila Ambuye bwino.<verse eid="1CO 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 7:36" />Mundhu waliyonjhe wakaona siwamchitila mwali wake ivo wakondwela, niika khala wakula, niwakafuna kukwatiwa basi wachite umo wafunila, siwachita machimo wamkwatepe. <verse eid="1CO 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 7:37" />Nambho ngati wammuna, wakalamula mwenewake mumtima mwake osakwate popande kukakamizidwa ni walionjhe, ningati wakhoza kujhilamula basi wachita bwino siwadamkwata wamkaziyo. <verse eid="1CO 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 7:38" />Chimwecho wammuna uyo wakwata wachita bwino, ni wammuna uyo siwakwata wachita bwino kupunda.<verse eid="1CO 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 7:39" />Wammkazi wakwatiwa wamangidwa ni thauko ngati pe wammuna wali wamoyo, nambho ngati wammuna wamwalila basi wamkazi mmeneyo wakakonda wakhoza kukwatiwa ni wammuna mwina, nambhope wakwatiwe ni wammuna uyo wamkhulupilila Yesu. <verse eid="1CO 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 7:40" />Umo nionela ine mbasa wakhale chimwecho popande kukwatiwa, yameneyo ni maganizo yanga, ni nikhulupilila kuti nilinawo Mzimu wa Mnungu.<verse eid="1CO 7:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CO 8" />
  <para style="s">Vakudya ivo vachochedwa mahoka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 8:1" />Chipano nghani ya chijha nalemba kwa vakudya va mahoka.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 8:1">Tijhiwa ife taonjhe tali ni njelu, njelu zitipacha dama, nambho chikondi chitikonja. <verse eid="1CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 8:2" />Wonjhe yao aganiza kuti ajhiwa bwino vindhu fulani, zenedi sajhiwa ngati umo afunikila kujhiwa. <verse eid="1CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 8:3" />Nambho mundhu wamkonda Mnungu, wajhiwika ni Mnungu.<verse eid="1CO 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 8:4" />Chimwecho, nghani ya kudya vakudya ivo vachochedwa mahoka, tijhiwa kuti, chiboliboli osati kandhu pajhiko nikuti kuli Mnungu mmojhipe. <verse eid="1CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 8:5" />Ata ngati alipo atanidwa “minungu,” ikhale kumwamba kapina pajhiko, ni ata ngati kuli “minungu yambili” ni “mambuye ambili,” <verse eid="1CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 8:6" />nambho kwa ife walipo Mnungu mmojhi, Tate, uyo waumba vindhu vonjhe ni kupitila iye tikhala amoyo, ni kuli Mbuye mmojhi, Yesu Kilisito, kupitila Yesu Kilisito vindhu vonjhe vaumbidwa ni kwa ndande yake ife tikhala amoyo.<verse eid="1CO 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 8:7" />Nambho osati kilammojhi wajhiwa uzene uwu. Wandhu akumojhi kwa kuzowelela kuchocha njhembe kwa viboliboli akali kuganiza kuti vakudya vonjhe vachochedwa kwa mahoka, ni ndande sakakhulupilile bwino ajhiona kuti achita chindhu icho chidavomelezeke ni Mnungu. <verse eid="1CO 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 8:8" />Nambho chakudya sichikhoza kutisendeza pafupi ni Mnungu, sitichepecha chilichonjhe ngati sitidya, ata tikadya sitichulucha chindhu.<verse eid="1CO 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 8:9" />Nambho ukhale maso, uwu ufulu wanu usadaachiticha anyiwajha achepekedwa chikhulupi ammsiye Mnungu. <verse eid="1CO 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 8:10" />Mate yake mundhu wali ni chikhulupi chaching'ono wakakuona iwe, “Uli ni chikhulupi chachikulu,” ukudya chakudya ivo vachochedwa mahokha, ichimikiza ata iye nayo wadye vindhu va mahoka? <verse eid="1CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 8:11" />Ni uyu mundhu wali ni chikhulupi cha ching'ono, uyo Kilisito wadamwalila ndande yake, wayomwechedwa ndande ya “kujhiwa kwako!” <verse eid="1CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 8:12" />Chimwecho, yapo mchita machimo kwa achabale wanu kwa njila iyi ni kwaika chilonda, mumlakwila Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 8:13" />Chimwecho, ngati chakudya chikamkwiicha mbale wakhulupila wachite machimo, sinidyanjho nyama, dala sidamchita wakhulupila wachite machimo.<verse eid="1CO 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CO 9" />
  <para style="s">Njhito ni vijha wafunika kupachidwa mtumwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 9:1" />Bwanji ine osati kapolo? Bwanji ine sinidamwone Yesu Ambuye wathu? Bwanji osati ine nakuchogozani kumkhulupilila Yesu? <verse eid="1CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 9:2" />Atangati kwa wandhu wina ine osati Mtumwi, nambho zene anyiimwe muvomela ine ni mtumwi kwanu, anyiimwe kumkhulupila kwanu Yesu kulangiza kuti ine ni mtumwi.<verse eid="1CO 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 9:3" />Kwa wandhu yawo anichucha, ine nikamba chimwechi. <verse eid="1CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 9:4" />Bwanji ine sinifunika kupachidwa chakudya ni chakumwa kwa njhito yanga? <verse eid="1CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 9:5" />Bwanji, sitifunika kumanga ulendo ni mkazi wakhulupila, ngati umo achitila atumwi wina ni achabale a Yesu ni Petulo? <verse eid="1CO 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 9:6" />Bwanji ine ni Banaba nde tifunika kuchita njhito dala tikhale amoyo? <verse eid="1CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 9:7" />Bwanji, asikali yuti wapita kundeo kwa malipilo yake mwene wake? Mlimi yuti siwakudya vipacho vya munda wa zabibu? Owesa viweto yuti uyo siwakumwa likama la viweto vake?<verse eid="1CO 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 9:8" />Nambho nili ni vifani vambili mu ukhalo wa kila siku kwa nghani ijha nakamba, thauko la Musa ilo wapachidwa ni Mnungu nalo likambanjho chimwecho. <verse eid="1CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 9:9" />Pakuti, yalembedwa muthauko la Musa ilo wapachidwa ni Mnungu, “Usaicheka ng'ombe kukamwa yapo ipukutula ngano.” Bwanji Mnungu yapa wausika ni ng'ombe? <verse eid="1CO 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 9:10" />Zene Mnungu siwakamba yaya ndande yathu? Zene yalembedwa ndande yathu, pakuti mlimi wa vakudya wavomeleka kulima kwa chikhulupi, ni iye okolola vakudya wadikila kupheza vakudya. <verse eid="1CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 9:11" />Ikakhala ife tidakupachani mawu la Mnungu pakati panu. Bwanji sitifunika kupata vindhu ndande ya umoyo uwu kuchoka kwanu? <verse eid="1CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 9:12" />Ngati wina apachidwa mthandizo kuchoka kwanu, idakafunika ife tipachidwe vindhu vimenevo kupitilila anyiiwo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 9:12">Nambo ife sitidapachidwe vindhu vimenevo, mmalo mwake tilimba mtima kwa kila kandhu dala sitida chekeleza Uthenga Wabwino wa Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 9:13" />Bwanji simujhiwa kuti wandhu achita njhito mnyumba ya Mnungu apata chakudya kuchokela mnyumba ya Mnungu, ni anyiwajha achita kumazabao apata njhembe ya kumazabao. <verse eid="1CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 9:14" />Chimwecho, Ambuye alamula kuti wajha alalikila Uthenga apheze mkokolo kuchokana ni ulaliki.<verse eid="1CO 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 9:15" />Nambho ine sinida tumile ata imojhi ya vivomelezedwe vimenevo, nane sinilemba yaya kukhulupilila kuti simunichitile yameneyo. Ine kwanga mbasa nimwalile osati kumchita mundhu waone nijhielekela! <verse eid="1CO 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 9:16" />Nambho yapo nilalikila Uthenga sinikhoza kujhielekela pakuti napacidwa njhito ya kulalikila nambho sinivutike ngati sinilalikila Uthenga. <verse eid="1CO 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 9:17" />Nikaichita njhito iyi kwa kufuna kwanga nidaka dikila mkokolo, nambho pakuti sinida sanghe kuichita njhito iyi, chimwecho ni njhito napachidwa niichite. <verse eid="1CO 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 9:18" />Chimwecho mkokolo wanga chindhu chanji, basi? Mkokolo wanga ni kulalikila Uthenga Wabwino chajhe, popande kufuna mkokolo wa kulalikila Uthenga Wabwino.<verse eid="1CO 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 9:19" />Chimwecho nalimfulu, osati kapolo wamundhu waliyonjhe Sinimangika, nidajhichita kapolo wakila mundhu ili nipheze kwaguza wandhu ambili kumkhulupilila Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 9:20" />Kwa Ayahudi nidali ngati Ayahudi, dala natangatile Ayahudi ambili aomboledwe, anyiwajha ali panjhi pa thauko la Musa, dala nikhoze kwapata anyiwajha adali panjhi pa thauko. <verse eid="1CO 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 9:21" />Chimwecho, kwa anyiwajha osati Ayahudi nidakhala ngati anyiiwo dala nathangatile kumkhulupilila Kilisito. Ichi sichilangiza kuti ine sinilivela ni kulichata thauko la Mnungu, pakuti nabanidwa ni thauko la Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 9:22" />Yapo nidapita kwa osauka nidajhichita osauka, dala napate anyiiwo osauka. Nachita kila kandhu kwa wandhu wonjhe, dala napate kwa lamicha akumojhi wao.<verse eid="1CO 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 9:23" />Nichita yaya yonjhe ndande ya Uthenga Wabwino, dala ine ni anyiimwe tipate mwawi uwo uchoka kwa Mnungu. <verse eid="1CO 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 9:24" />Zene mujhiwa kuti paliwilo onjhe atamanga, nambho ni mmojhipe nde uyo wapachidwa mbhaso. Chimwecho tamangani liwilo dala mpate mbhaso. <verse eid="1CO 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 9:25" />Othamanga ajhikonjekela ni kujhimana vambili, achita chimwecho dala apate mbhaso yowanangika, nambo ife tichita chimweho dala tilandile mbhaso ya umoyo muyaya. <verse eid="1CO 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 9:26" />Chimwecho, yapo nithamanga dala nikhoze, nde umo nibulanilana, ine sinilingati obula nghondo uyo wabula nghonyo pachajhe. <verse eid="1CO 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 9:27" />Chimwecho, nilivuticha thupi langa ni kujhichekeleza kuti lichite ichonichifuna ni nikatho alalikila wina sinidakanidwa.<verse eid="1CO 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CO 10" />
  <para style="s">Msadalambila viboliboli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 10:1" />Achabale, nifuna mujhiwe icho chidaachokela anya mbuye yao amamchata Musa. Adali panjhi pa mtambo, nionjhe adayomboka nyanja ya mchele ya shamu. <verse eid="1CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 10:2" />Adabatizidwa onjhe kwa mtambo ni kwa nyanja ya mchele ngati ochatila a Musa. <verse eid="1CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 10:3" />Wonjhe adadya chakudya chinchijha icho chidachokela kumwamba kwa Mnungu, <verse eid="1CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 10:4" />ni wonjhe adamwa chakumwa chinchijha chidacho kwa Mnungu. Adamwa kuchoka mujha mumwala waukulu wa uzimu uwo udachata, ni mwala waukulu umeneo udali Kilisito mwene wake. <verse eid="1CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 10:5" />Nambho wandhu ambili sadachite vindhu ivo Mnungu wadafuna, chimwecho adamwalila ni vitanda vao vidayenela kunghalambo.<verse eid="1CO 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 10:6" />Chipano vindhu ivi ni chifani kwathu, dala kutuonya tisidakhumbila voipa ngati umo adachitila anyiiwo, <verse eid="1CO 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 10:7" />msada lambila viboliboli, ngati umo adachita akumojhi wao. Ngati umo yalembedwa malembo ya Mnungu, “Wandhu adakhala ni kumwa niadaima kuvina magule ya wandhu osamjhiwe Mnungu.” <verse eid="1CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 10:8" />Tisida chita chigololo ngati mujha adachitila akumojhi wao adagwa ni kumwalila wandhu elufu ishilini ni tatu. <verse eid="1CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 10:9" />Wala tisaayesa Ambuye ngati mujha adachitila akumojhi wao adamwalila kwa kulumidwa ni njoka. <verse eid="1CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 10:10" />Msidadandaulila yajha Mnungu wayachita ngati mujha adachitila akumojhi wao, Mnungu wadamtuma Mtumiki wa Mnungu wa kumwamba uyo wakupha kwaapha.<verse eid="1CO 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 10:11" />Basi vindhu ivi vidaapata anyiiwo ngati chifani kwatu, yadalembedwa dala kutionya ife. Tili amoyo pafupi ni mathelo ya jhiko.<verse eid="1CO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 10:12" />Yujha waganiza kuti waima pachikhulupi wapenye siwadagwa ni kuchita machimo. <verse eid="1CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 10:13" />Mayeso yonjhe mwapata yakawaida kwa wandhu. Nambho Mnungu ni wokhulupilika siwavomela muyesedwe kupitilila yayo muyakhoza, nambho yapo muyesedwa, siwakupacheni njila yotulukila ili mukhoze kulimba mtima.<verse eid="1CO 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 10:14" />Chimwecho achabale wanga, thawani, msadalambila viboliboli. <verse eid="1CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 10:15" />Nikamba ni anyiimwe wandhu muli ni njelu, lamulani mwachinawene kwa nghani ya ivi nivikamba. <verse eid="1CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 10:16" />Chikho chijha cha mwawi tichitumila kwa chakudya cha Mbuye, sitigwilizana ni mwazi wa Kilisito? Ni yapo tibandhula lijha bumunda, sitigwilizana ni thupi la Kilisito? <verse eid="1CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 10:17" />Pakuti bumunda nilimojhi, ife taonjhe tili ambili tili thupi limojhi, taonjhe tililandila bumunda limwelo limojhi.<verse eid="1CO 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 10:18" />Apenyeni wandhu a Izilaeli, anyiwajha wonjhe akudya chakudya chamahoka alunjana ni mazabao imeneyo. <verse eid="1CO 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 10:19" />Chipano, nikambe chiyani, kuti chijha chachochedwa njhembe kwa viboliboli ni chindhu? <verse eid="1CO 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 10:20" />Osati! Nambho ichonikamba nikuti, njhembe izo achocha wandhu siamjhiwa Mnungu. Simwachochela Amnungu nambho muvichochela viwanda, nane sinifuna anyiimwe mkhale ni mgwilizano ni viwanda. <verse eid="1CO 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 10:21" />Simukhoza kukhala pa pwando la Ambuye pamojhi ni viwanda. Simukhoza kudya chakudya ni kumwa pamojhi pa pwando la Ambuye ni kugwilizana kudya chakudya ni kumwa pamojhi pa pwando la viwanda. <verse eid="1CO 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 10:22" />Bwanji, tifuna kwachita Ambuye akhale ni njhanje? Mganiza tili ni mbhavu kupitilila iye?<verse eid="1CO 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 10:23" />Wandhu wina akamba “Vindhu vonjhe valoledwa, yetu, nambho ine nikamba asati kila chindhu ni chabwino,” Chimwecho wina akamba, “Vindhu vonjhe valoledwa nambho asati kila chindhu chifunika.” Nambho ine nikamba osati kila chindhu chitangatila kulilimbicha gulu la wandhu akhulupilila Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 10:24" />Mundhu, waliyonjhe siwada funafuna vindhu vake mwene nambho wafunefune ni vindhu va wina.<verse eid="1CO 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 10:25" />Muvomeledwa kudya kila icho chigulichidwa pamalo pa malonda wandhu ambili, popande kufunjha funjha kujhiwa ngati chabwino kapina opande chabwino kudya. <verse eid="1CO 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 10:26" />Kwaife, yalembedwa mu malembo ya Mnungu, “Jhiko ni vindhu vonjhe ivo vilimo ni chuma cha Mbuye.”<verse eid="1CO 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 10:27" />Mundhu uyo siwadakhulupile wakakulalika kuchakudya, ni namwe mufuna kupita, idyani kila chindhu icho simuikilidwe popande kufunjha mafunjho yaliyonjhe ngati chabwino kapina osati chabwino. <verse eid="1CO 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 10:28" />Nambho mundhu wakakukambila, “Nyama iyi ya chochedwa njhembe kwa viboliboli,” msadya ndande ya kumuyaluza iye dala simudapwetekedwa mmitima yanu. <verse eid="1CO 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 10:29" />Yapa nikamba osati ndande ya kupweteka maganizo yanu nambho nikamba ndande ya kupweteka maganizo ya iye wakupacha.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 10:29">Simunifujhe, “Ndande yanji yajha nifuna kuchita ine yalamulidwe ni maganizo ya mundhu mwina? <verse eid="1CO 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 10:30" />Ngati ni muyamika Mnungu kwa chakudya changa, ndande yanji nilamulidwe kwa chakudya ichi nimuyamika Mnungu?”<verse eid="1CO 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 10:31" />Chimwecho, chalichonjhe icho mchita, ikakhala mkudya kapina kumwa, chitani yonjhe kwa kumtamanda Mnungu. <verse eid="1CO 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 10:32" />Mjhikala chimwecho, msadachiticha Ayahudi kapina Agiliki kusiya kumkhulupilila Kilisito kapina msadalichita gulu la wandhu wa Mnungu kuchita machimo. <verse eid="1CO 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 10:33" />Mchite ngati umo ine nichitila, nayesa kwakwadilicha kwamujha nachitila, pakuti sinifunafuna vabwino ndande yanga namwene, nambho nifunafuna vabwino ivo sivathangatile wina dala akhoze kuomboledwa.<verse eid="1CO 10:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CO 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 11:1" />Nichatizeni ine ngati umo ine nimchatiza Kilisito.<verse eid="1CO 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuvinikila mutu ndhawi yo lambila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 11:2" />Nikuyelekelani ndande mwanikumbukila mu vindhu vonjhe ni kuyachata mayaluzo nidakupachani. <verse eid="1CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 11:3" />Nambho nifuna mjhiwe kuti Kilisito wali ni ulamuli kwa kila wammuna, ni wammuna wali niulamuli kwa mkazake, ni Mnungu wali ni ulamuli kwa Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 11:4" />Chimwecho wammuna yapo wapembhela, kapina kuchocha ulosi uku wavinikila mutu mmeneyo siwamlemekeza Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 11:5" />Ni wamkazi waliyonjhe yapo wapembhela, kapina kulalikila Uthenga Wabwino, popande kumanga njhalu kumutu wake mmeneyo siwamlemekeza mmunake, uyo wachita chimwecho walingana ni wamkazi uyo wameta mpala. <verse eid="1CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 11:6" />Ngati wamkazi siwadamange njhalu kumutu, basi wasenge machichi. Ningati ninjhoni wamkazi kupupa, kapina kumeta mpala, basi mbasa wamange njhalu kumutu. <verse eid="1CO 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 11:7" />Nambho wammuna siwadavinikila mutu, ndande iye ni chifani ni ulemelelo wa Mnungu. Nambho wamkazi ni chifani cha wammuna, <verse eid="1CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 11:8" />ndande imeneyo, wammuna siwadaumbidwe kuchokela kwa wamkazi, nambho wamkazi waumbidwa kuchokela kwa wammuna. <verse eid="1CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 11:9" />Wammuna siwadaumbidwe kuthangatila wamkazi, nambho wamkazi ndeuyo wadaumbidwa kumthangatila wammuna. <verse eid="1CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 11:10" />Chimwecho nde ndande wamkazi wamanga njhalu mutu wake, ikhale chizindikilo pamwamba pa ulamuli uli pamwamba pake, ndande ya kwa akondwecha atumiki akumwamba Amnungu. <verse eid="1CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 11:11" />Atamchimwecho, pachogolo pa Ambuye, wamkazi wamkhulupilila wammuna, nayo wammuna wamkhulupilila wamkazi. <verse eid="1CO 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 11:12" />Ngati mujha wamkazi waumbidwa kwa wammuna, nambho wammuna wabalidwa ni wamkazi, Mnungu nde uyo wachita vonjhe.<verse eid="1CO 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 11:13" />Lamulani mwachinawene, ngati nibwino wamkazi wampembhe Mnungu popande kumanga njhalu kumutu. <verse eid="1CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 11:14" />Ata maumbidwe yene yatiyaluza kuti wammuna kukhala ni machichi ya mbili ninjhoni. <verse eid="1CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 11:15" />Nambho wamkazi wakakhala ni machichi yambili ni ufulu kwaiye. Nde ndande wapachidwa machichi yayatali dala yamvinikile. <verse eid="1CO 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 11:16" />Ngati mundhu wafuna kulimbana pa mwamba pa chindhu ichi, ndiipo wajhiwe kuti ife wala gulu la wandhu a Mnungu sitiijhiwa kuti umeneo nde mthethe wathu.<verse eid="1CO 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chakudya cha Ambuye</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:26-29">Matayo 26:26-29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-25">Maluko 14:22-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luka 22:14-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 11:17" />Yapo niendekela kukuninghani maagizo yaya sinikhoza kukuyelekelani panghani yaya yachatila, Yapo mphezana kumlambila Mnungu anyiimwe mwakhulupilila zenedi vindhu voipa nde vichokela kupitilila vindhu vabwino. <verse eid="1CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 11:18" />Choyamba, navela yapomkomana pamojhi ngati gulu la wandhu amkhulupilila Yesu nivela mupatulana, nane nikhulupila pang'ono. <verse eid="1CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 11:19" />Mate yake ifunika pakhale nikupatulana pakati panu, dala kulangiza kuti achiyani yawo akhulupilila Yesu azene. <verse eid="1CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 11:20" />Zene yapo mkomana pamojhi, nambho simukudya chakudya cha Ambuye. <verse eid="1CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 11:21" />Pakuti kila mmojhi wakudya chakudya chake popande kudya ni mnjake, mbaka akumojhi wanu akhala ni njala, kapina akhala bila chakumwa, nambho wina akudya ni kumwa mbaka kulojhela. <verse eid="1CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 11:22" />Bwanji simkhoza kudya ni kumwa kumakomo yanu? Kapina mudelela gulu la wandhu amkhulupilila Kilisito, ni kwalengecha njhoni anyiyao alibe kandhu? Nikukambileni chiyani? Nikuyelekeleni? Notho osati kwa yameneyo!<verse eid="1CO 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 11:23" />Pakuti ine nidalandila kwa Ambuye yajha mayaluzo nidakupelekelani, kuti usiku ujha Ambuye Yesu, yapo wadachochedwa wadatenga bumunda, <verse eid="1CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 11:24" />wadamuyamika Mnungu, wadaubandhula, wadakamba, “Ili nithupi langa, ilo lachochedwa ndande yanu. Chitani chimwechi kwa kunikumbukila.” <verse eid="1CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 11:25" />Chimwechijha, pambuyo pakudya wadatenga chiko niwakamba, “Chikho ichi ni chipangano cha chipano cha Mnungu, chichimikizidwa kwa mwazi wanga. Chitani chimwechi kila yapo mkumwa, kwa kunikumbukila.”<verse eid="1CO 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 11:26" />Pakuti kila yapo simujhidya bumunda ili ni kumwa mchikho ichi, muuzila wina Ambuye adafa ndande yanu mbaka yapo siwajhe. <verse eid="1CO 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 11:27" />Chimwecho, kila uyo wakudya bumunda la Ambuye, ni kumwa mchikho ichi ngati umo siifunikila, siwakhale wachita machimo kwa thupi ni mwazi wa Ambuye. <verse eid="1CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 11:28" />Ifunika, mundhu wajhipenyecheche mwene, ukali osadye bumunda ni kumwa mchikho. <verse eid="1CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 11:29" />Pakuti mundhu uyo wakudya ni kumwa, popande kujhiwa mate ya thupi la Ambuye, kwa kuchita chimwecho Mnungu siwakulange. <verse eid="1CO 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 11:30" />Nde ndande ambili pakati panu ali odwala ni ofooka, ni wina mbaka amwalila. <verse eid="1CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 11:31" />Nambho ngati tidakajipenyechecha bwino tikali osadye, Mnungu siwadaka tilamula. <verse eid="1CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 11:32" />Nambho yapo tilamulidwa ni kulangidwa ni Ambuye tijhikhala ni ulemu, ili sitidalangidwa pamojhi ni wandhu samkhulupilila Yesu.<verse eid="1CO 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 11:33" />Chimwecho, abale wanga, yapo mkomanika kudya Chakudya cha Ambuye mjhilindana. <verse eid="1CO 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 11:34" />Mundhu wakakhala ni njala, wadye kukhomo lake, dala kukomanikana kwanu sikudakhala ndande ya kulamulidwa, ninghani ya yayo yakhalila sinikuyangheni yapo sinijhe kwanu.<verse eid="1CO 11:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CO 12" />
  <para style="s">Mbhaso za Mzimu wa Mnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 12:1" />Chipano nghani ya vijha mwalemba pa mbhaso za Mzimu Wa Mnungu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 12:1">Nifuna mujhiwe bwino vindhu ivi abale wanga. <verse eid="1CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 12:2" />Mujhiwa yapo mdali mkali osamjhiwe Mnungu, mdatengedwa kulambila viboliboli. <verse eid="1CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 12:3" />Nifuna mujhiwe kuti mundhu waliyonjhe uyo wachogozedwa ni Mzimu wa Mnungu, siwakhoza kukamba, “Yesu walesedwe!” Chinchijha mundhu waliyonjhe siwakhoza kukamba “Yesu ni Ambuye,” popande kuchogozedwa ni Mzimu wa Mnungu.<verse eid="1CO 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 12:4" />Pali mbhaso zosianasiana za Mzimu wa Mnungu, nambho zonjhe zichoka kwa Mzimu ni mweyujha mmojhi. <verse eid="1CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 12:5" />Tena pali mitundu yosiana yotumikila Ambuye, yonjhe ichoka kwa iye yujha. <verse eid="1CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 12:6" />Pali mitundu yosianasiana yochita njhito, nambho Mnungu ni mmojhi, iye ndeuyo watikhozecha kuchita njhito zonjhe. <verse eid="1CO 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 12:7" />Nambho, mbhaso za muuzimu apachidwa wandhu osiyanasiyana dala za thangatile wandhu wina. <verse eid="1CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 12:8" />Mzimu umpacha mundhu mmojhi mawu la ekima, ni mwina mawu lojhiwa umowakondela Mzimu mmeneyo. <verse eid="1CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 12:9" />Mzimu umweo umpacha mwina kukhoza kukhulupilila kwa kukulu, ni mwina wampacha kukhoza kulamicha odwala. <verse eid="1CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 12:10" />Mzimu umpacha mwina mbhaso yochita vodabwicha, mwina wampacha ulosi, mwina wampacha kusiyanicha mbhaso zichoka kwa Mnungu ni opande kwa Mnungu, mwina wampacha kukamba mikambo ya chilendo, mwina mbhaso yotambulila mikambo ya chilendo. <verse eid="1CO 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 12:11" />Ivi vonjhe yachitika ni Mzimu mmojhi, ni mzimu umenewo nde uwo umpacha kila mundhu mbhaso yake.<verse eid="1CO 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thupi limojhi viwalo vambili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 12:12" />Ngati umo ili thupi ni limojhi, nambho lili ni viwalo vambili, atangati viwalo valivambili vichita thupi limojhi, nde umo ili kwa Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 12:13" />Pakuti kwa Mzimu mmojhi, taonjhe tidabatizidwa kwa thupi limojhi, atangati Ayahudi kapina Agiliki, akapolo au osati akapolo, ni taonjhe tapachidwa ni Mzimu mmojhi.<verse eid="1CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 12:14" />Pakuti thupi lilibe chiwalo chimojhi, nambho viwalo vambili. <verse eid="1CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 12:15" />Ngati mwendo udakakamba, “Ndande ine opande jhanja, chimwecho ine opande wa thupi,” kwa kukamba chimwecho nde idakachita jhanja silidakhala chiwalo cha thupi. <verse eid="1CO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 12:16" />Ngati khutu lidakakamba, “Ndande ine opande diso, chimwecho ine opande wa thupi,” Kwa kukamba chimwecho idakachita khutu silidakhala chiwalo cha thupi. <verse eid="1CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 12:17" />Ngati thupi lonjhe lidakakhala diso, kuvela kudakali kuti? Ngati thupi lonjhe lidakali khutu kununjha kudakali kuti? <verse eid="1CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 12:18" />Nambho ndeumo ili Mnungu waika viwalo va mitundu yosiana mthupi, kila chiwalo ngati umo wafunila Mnungu. <verse eid="1CO 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 12:19" />Ngati viwalo vonjhe vidakali chiwalo chimojhi thupi lidakali kuti? <verse eid="1CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 12:20" />Uzene, nikuti kulini viwalo vambili nambho thupi limojhi.<verse eid="1CO 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 12:21" />Chimwecho, diso silikhoza kulikambila jhanja, “Sinikufuna!” Ata mutu siukhoza kuukambila mwendo, “Chabwino sinikufunani!” <verse eid="1CO 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 12:22" />Nambho pamalo pake, vijha viwalo va thupi ivovioneka vofooka ndeivo vifunika kupunda, <verse eid="1CO 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 12:23" />ni viwalo vonjhe ivo sivilemekezeka, viwalo vimenevo ndeivo tivilemekeza kupunda, ni viwalo va thupi ivo sividakhadwe ndeivo vakhadwa kupunda, <verse eid="1CO 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 12:24" />vijha viwalo vabwino sivifunika kusungidwa. Mnungu mwene waviika pamojhi viwalo vathupi nikuvipacha ulemu kupunda vijha vachepekela ulemu. <verse eid="1CO 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 12:25" />Dala pasadakhala kulekana kwa thupi, ila viwalo vonjhe vilelane nivinjake. <verse eid="1CO 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 12:26" />Ngati chiwalo chimojhi chikapwetekedwa, viwalo vonjhe vipwetekedwa, ni chiwalo chimojhi chikaelekeledwa, ni viwalo vina vikondwa pamojhi niicho.<verse eid="1CO 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 12:27" />Anyiimwe mwaonjhe ni thupi la Kilisito, ni kila mmojhi wanu nichiwalo cha thupi limenelo. <verse eid="1CO 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 12:28" />Mnungu waika kila chindhu mu gulu la wandhu amkhulupilila Yesu, woyamba atumwi, akawili alosi, akatatu oyaluza, ndiipo ochita vodabwicha, ni mbhaso yo lamicha, mbhaso yotangatila wina, ni wandhu okamba mikambo ya chilendo. <verse eid="1CO 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 12:29" />Asati wonjhe ni atumwi ni asati onjhe alosi ni asati onjhe ni oyaluza. Asati onjhe achita vodabwicha. <verse eid="1CO 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 12:30" />Osati onjhe ali ni mbhaso yolamicha matenda ni osati onjhe akhoza kukamba mikambo yachilendo, ni asati wonjhe akhoza kutambulia mikambo ya chilendo. <verse eid="1CO 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 12:31" />Muendekele kukhumbila, kupata mbhaso za zofunika, nde yapo simpate mbhaso zazikulu kupunda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 12:31">Atachimwecho nakulangizani njila ya bwino.<verse eid="1CO 12:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CO 13" />
  <para style="s">Chikondi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 13:1" />Ata ngati, nikamba kwa mikambo ya wandhu ni atumiki akumwamba a Mnungu, nambho ngati nilibe chikondi, nikhala ngati mvekelo wa chibekete ichochilibe kandhu kapina chingwangwa. <verse eid="1CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 13:2" />Ndiponjho ata ngati, nali ni mbhaso yolalikila Uthenga wa Mnungu, ni kujhiwa nghani zonjhe za Mnungu ni hekima zonjhe, atangati nali nichikhulupi chokwana mbaka kukhoza kuzula phili ngati nilibe chikondi ine asati kandhu. <verse eid="1CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 13:3" />Nikachocha kila chindhu, nikwapacha ausiwa, nikuchocha thupi langa libuchidwe nambho ngati nilibe chikondi, siinithangatila kandhu.<verse eid="1CO 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 13:4" />Uyo wali ni chikondi waembekeza, wathangatila, uyo wali nichikondi walibe njhanje, walibe dama, kapina kujhiona, <verse eid="1CO 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 13:5" />uyo wali ni chikondi siwachepa ulemu, uyo wali ni chikondi siwafuna vindhu va kumthangatila mwene, kapina mbhwai za msanga, siwasunga chikumbukilo cha voipa, <verse eid="1CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 13:6" />mundhu wa chikondi siwakondwela voipa, nambho chikondwela uzene. <verse eid="1CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 13:7" />Mundhu wachikondi wapilila yonjhe, mundhu wa chikondi wakhulupila wina, mundhu wa chikondi waembekeza, ni siwalepela.<verse eid="1CO 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 13:8" />Chikondi chiendekela sikuzonjhe, nambho ukakhalapo ulosi siuthele, ikakhalapo mikambo siithela kukakhalapo kujhiwa nako sikuthele. <verse eid="1CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 13:9" />Pakuti sitijhiwa kila kandhu, ni sitijhiwa kulalikila Uthenga wa Mnungu bwinobwino, <verse eid="1CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 13:10" />nambho pasiku zikujha sitijhiwe kila chindhu ngati umo chili, ni vijha tivijhiwa pang'ono sivisowe.<verse eid="1CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 13:11" />Yapo nidali mwana wakhanda, mawu yanga, kujhiwa ni maganizo yanga yadali ngati mwana wakhanda, nambho chipano nakula vindhu vijha va ubwana navisiya. <verse eid="1CO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 13:12" />Icho tichiona saino, chili ngati sitijhiona bwino pa chiyoo icho chili ni majhi, nambho pambuyo sitione kila chindhu padanga. Chipano tijhiwa pang'ono nambho pambuyo sitijhiwe uzene onjhe, ngati umo Mnungu watijhiwila ife bwino.<verse eid="1CO 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 13:13" />Chipano sivikhalile vindhu ivi vitatu, kumkhulupilila Mnungu, kulandila vindhu kuchoka kwa Mnungu, ni kwakonda wina, nambho chindhu cha chikulu ni kwakonda wina.<verse eid="1CO 13:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CO 14" />
  <para style="s">Mbhaso zina za Mzimu wa Mnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 14:1" />Mfunefune kukhala ni chikondi, ni kufuna mbhaso za Muzimu. Hasa mfunefune kupunda kulalikila Uthenga wa Mnungu. <verse eid="1CO 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 14:2" />Pakuti, anyiyao akamba kwa mikambo ya chilendo, siakamba ni wandhu ila akamba ni Mnungu, ndande palibe uyo wamuelewa nambho wakamba vindhu va chisisi va mumzimu mwake. <verse eid="1CO 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 14:3" />Nambho iye walalikila Uthenga wa Mnungu wakamba, wakamba ni wandhu mau yakwakonja, ni kwathila mtima pa kumkhulupilila Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 14:4" />Mundhu wakamba kwa mikambo ya chilendo wajhiika bwino, nambho uyo walalikila Uthenga wa Mnungu wakonja gulu la wandhu akhulupilila Yesu.<verse eid="1CO 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 14:5" />Nidakakonda kila mmojhi wakambe kwa mkambo wapachidwa ni Mzimu wa Mnungu, nambho nidakakonda kupunda mkhale ni mbhaso ya kuuzila uthenga wa Mnungu, pakuti mundhu uyo wauzila uthenga wa Mnungu wachita bwino kupunda kusiyana ni uyo wakamba kwa mikambo yachilendo, nambho ifunika wakhalepo mundhu uyo wavifotokoza vindhu vimenevo, dala gulu la wandhu amjhiwa Kilisito lithangatilidwe. <verse eid="1CO 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 14:6" />Chipano, nikajha kwanu nikukamba kwa mikambo yachilendo siikutangatilani chiyani? Nambho nikakukambilani maloso yayo napachidwa kuchoka kwa Mnungu, kapina nikakupachani njelu, nikachocha ulosi kapina mayaluzo pamenepo siikhale nakuthangatilani.<verse eid="1CO 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 14:7" />Ata vindhu ivo vilibe umoyo, yapo vichocha mvekelo ngati chimwechi, vitolilo, zeze, mundhu siwajhiwe bwanji nyimbo iimbidwa ngati palibe misambo yotimba? <verse eid="1CO 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 14:8" />Ni ngati, mbetete ikalila popande mvekelo uwo siujhiwika kuti wachiyani yani uyo siwajhikonjekele kwa ndeo? <verse eid="1CO 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 14:9" />Chinchijha, ni anyiimwe mkakamba mawu siyajhiwika siajhiwe bwanji ilo mkamba? Pakuti simjhikamba mmwambammwamba! <verse eid="1CO 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 14:10" />Kuli mikambo yambili pajhiko, ila yonjhe ili nimate. <verse eid="1CO 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 14:11" />Nambho ikakhala ine sinijhiwa mate yamkambo uwo wakamba mundhu mwina, ine sinikhale mlendo kwake mundhu mmeneyo, niiye siwakhale mlendo kwaine. <verse eid="1CO 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 14:12" />Mchomwe, ni anyiimwe pakuti mkhumbila kukhala ni mbhaso za Mumzimu, ni mjhitaidi kupunda kupeza vijha vitangatila kumanga gulu la wandhu amkhulupilila Yesu.<verse eid="1CO 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 14:13" />Chimwecho mundhu wakamba mkambo wachilendo, niwapembhe kupata kukhoza kutambulila chijha wakamba. <verse eid="1CO 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 14:14" />Pakuti nikapembha kwa mkambo wachilendo, mzimu wanga ndeuwo upembha, nambho njelu zanga zikhala chajhe. <verse eid="1CO 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 14:15" />Nichite chiyani, ndiipo sinipembhe kwa mzimu wanga, sinipembhenjho kwa njelu yanga, niimbe kwa mzimu wanga, niimbenjho kwa njelu yanga. <verse eid="1CO 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 14:16" />Ukamtamanda Mnungu kwa mzimu wakope, siwakhoze bwanji mundhu wakawida wali pa msonghano wa kumlambila Mnungu kutanikila pembhelo lako la mayamiko kwakukamba “Ikhale mchimwecho” Ngati siwajhiwa icho ukamba. <verse eid="1CO 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 14:17" />Pembhelo lako la mayamiko likhoza kukhala la bwino, nambho mundhu mwina silimthangatila.<verse eid="1CO 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 14:18" />Nimuyamika Mnungu pakuti ine nikamba mikambo ya chilendo kupitilila anyiimwe mwaonjhe. <verse eid="1CO 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 14:19" />Nambho, mu misonghano ya mugulu ya wandhu amkhulupilila Yesu, mbasa nikambe mawu yasano yamate kwa njelu dala naayaluze wina kusiyana ni kukamba mawu maelufu ya mkambo wa chilendo.<verse eid="1CO 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 14:20" />Abale msakhala ngati wana mumaganizo yanu, nambho pa vindhu voipa, mkhale ngati wana akhanda, nambho pa kuganiza kwanu mukhale wandhu mwakula. <verse eid="1CO 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 14:21" />Malembo ya Mnungu yalembedwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">“Kwakupitila wandhu akamba mkambo wachilendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">sinikambane ni wandhu akamba Ambuye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">Sinikambe kwakupitila milomo ya alendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">nambho atachimwecho sianivechela.”<verse eid="1CO 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 14:22" />Chimwecho, mbhaso yokamba mkambo wachilendo nichizindikilo opande kwa anyiyao amkhulupilila Kilisito, nambho kwa anyiyao siadamkhulupile Kilisito, nambho mbhaso yolalikila Uthenga wa Mnungu ni ndande kwa anyiyao amkhulupila Kilisito, ni osati ndande ya anyiyao siadamkhulupile Kilisito.<verse eid="1CO 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 14:23" />Chimwecho ngati gulu lonjhe la wandhu amkhulupilila Kilisito, ni wonjhe yapo akomana pamojhi, ni onjhe akayamba kukamba kwa mkambo wa chilendo, akalowa wandhu akawaida kapina osamkhulupila Kilisito, bwanji, sakamba anyiimwe amsala? <verse eid="1CO 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 14:24" />Nambho wonjhe ikakhala alalikila Uthenga wa Mnungu, wakajha mundhu siwaelewa kapina siwada mkhulupile Kilisito, yonjhe siwaya vele siyamchimikizile kuipa kwake mwene. Ni yonjhe siwayavele siyamlamule mwene, <verse eid="1CO 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 14:25" />yabisika mumtima mwake siyaikidwe pandhandala, ni siwagwade ni kumlambila Mnungu uku niwalapa, “Zene Mnungu wali pamojhi namwe!”<verse eid="1CO 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umo ifunikila kuchita pa kulambila Mnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 14:26" />Ichi ndeicho nikamba abale, yapo mkomana pamojhi kumlambila Mnungu, mwina waimbe nyimbo, mwina wayaluze, mwina wakhale ni maloso ya Mnungu, mwina wakambe kwa mkambo wa chilendo, mwina watambulile chijha chakambika, yonjhe yakhale ndande yakutangatila gulu la wandhu amkhulupilila Yesu. <verse eid="1CO 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 14:27" />Ngati mundhu waliyonjhe wakamba kwa mkambo wachilendo, basi akambe awili kapina atatu, osati kupitilila, mmojhi pambuyo pa mwina, niifunika wakhalepo wotambulila. <verse eid="1CO 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 14:28" />Nambho ngati palibe uyo wakhoza kutambulila, ndiipo ifunika uyo wakamba mkambo wa chilendo wasiye kukamba yapo asonganika, ni wajhikambile mwene wake ni Mnungu. <verse eid="1CO 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 14:29" />Awili kapina atatu ngati apachidwa Uthenga wa Mnungu akambe, ni wina ayapenyecheche yayo yakambidwa. <verse eid="1CO 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 14:30" />Ngati mundhu wakhala kumsonghano wa kumlambila Mnungu wapeza maloso kuchoka kwa Mnungu, yujha wakamba waleke kukamba. <verse eid="1CO 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 14:31" />Pakuti mwaonjhe mukhoza kulalikila Uthenga wa Mnungu, mmojhi pambuyo pa mwina, dala mwaonjhe mkhoze kujhiyaluza ni kuthilidwa mtima. <verse eid="1CO 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 14:32" />Uyo wali ni mbhaso za kulalikila Uthenga wa Mnungu ifunika wailamule nimbhaso imeneyo, <verse eid="1CO 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 14:33" />pakuti Mnungu osati Mnungu wosokaniza, nambho Mnungu wa mtendele.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 14:33">Ngati umo ili mu gulu la wandhu amkhulupilila Yesu, <verse eid="1CO 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 14:34" />wachikazi akhale kimya mumsonghano. Safunika kukamba, ngati umo likambila thauko la Ayahudi, ajhichiche. <verse eid="1CO 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 14:35" />Ikakhala afuna kujiyaluza chindhu, afunika wafunjhe acha amunao kukhomo. Pakuti ni manyazi wamkazi kukamba mugulu la wandhu amkhulupilila Yesu.<verse eid="1CO 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 14:36" />Kapina mawu la Mnungu lidachoka kwanu? Kapina lakujhelani anyiimwepe? <verse eid="1CO 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 14:37" />Mundhu wakajhiona iye ni mthenga wa Mnungu kapina wali ni mbhaso ya mu Mzimu, ni wayajhiwe yaya nikulembelani anyiimwe nilamulo la Ambuye. <verse eid="1CO 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 14:38" />Nambho mundhu ngati wadelela yameneyo, ata anyimwe mumdelele.<verse eid="1CO 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 14:39" />Chimwecho, abale wanga mfunika kukhumbila kupunda kulalikila Uthenga wa Mnungu, nambho simudamkaniza mundhu kukamba kwa mkambo wa chilendo. <verse eid="1CO 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 14:40" />Chimwecho vonjhe vichitike ngati umo ifunikila umo ifunikila.<verse eid="1CO 14:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CO 15" />
  <para style="s">Kuhyuka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 15:1" />Chipano nifuna kukumbuchani anyiimwe abale wanga, ujha Uthenga Wabwino nidakulalikilani, namwenjho mudaikhulupilila, ni kuima nganganga. <verse eid="1CO 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 15:2" />Kupitila Uthenga Wabwino mulamichidwa, ikakhala ngati mupotela njhito Uthenga uwo nidakulalikilani, ila ngati simusiye, kukhulupilila kwanu kudali kwachajhe.<verse eid="1CO 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 15:3" />Ine nidakupachani vindhu ivo nidavilandila, kuti Kilisito wadamwalila kwa ndande ya machimo yathu, ngati umo yalembedwela malembo ya Mnungu, <verse eid="1CO 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 15:4" />kuti wadazikidwa ni siku la katatu wadahyuka, ngati umoyalembedwela malembo ya Mnungu, <verse eid="1CO 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 15:5" />kuti wadamtulukila Kefa, ndiipo pambuyo wadaatulukila wajha khumi ni awili. <verse eid="1CO 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 15:6" />Pambuyo wadatulukila yawo amkhulipila Kilisito miathano, kwapamojhi, ambili wao akali amoyo, nambho wina adathomwalila. <verse eid="1CO 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 15:7" />Pambuyo wadamtulukila Yakobo, ndiipo wadatulukila atumwi wonjhe.<verse eid="1CO 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 15:8" />Pothela wadanitulukila ine Poolo uyo nidali ngati uyo wabadwa kwa njila yozizwicha. <verse eid="1CO 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 15:9" />Mateyake ine sinijhika ngati umo ajhiwikila atumwi wina, ni sinifunika kutanidwa mtumwi, ndande nidalivuticha gulu la wandhu amkhulupilila Yesu. <verse eid="1CO 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 15:10" />Nambho kwa ubwino wa Mnungu nali ngati umu nali, ni ubwino wake siudali chajhe, ine nachita njhito kupitilila atumwi wonjhe, osati ine nambho ubwino wa a Mnungu uchita njhito pamojhi ni ine. <verse eid="1CO 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 15:11" />Chimwecho, ikhale ine nidalalikila kapina anyiiwo atumwi wina adalakila Uthenga Wabwino, ata chimwecho taonjhe tilalikila Uthenga uwu uwo tidaukhulupilila.<verse eid="1CO 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhyuka kwathu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 15:12" />Chipano, pakuti talalikila kuti Kilisito wadahyuka, mbona akumojhi wanu akamba wandhu akufa sahyuka? <verse eid="1CO 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 15:13" />Ngati palibe kuhyuka, basi ata Kilisito nayo siwadahyuke, <verse eid="1CO 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 15:14" />Ni ikakhala Kilisito siwadahyuke, basi kulalikila kwathu kulibe mate ni kukhulupilila kwanu kulibe mate. <verse eid="1CO 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 15:15" />Kupitilila yameneyo, ife tidakakhala amboni amthila pachogolo pa Mnungu, ndande tidakamba kuti Mnungu wadamhyukicha Kilisito, kumbe iye siwadamhyukiche, nambho limenelo silikhoza kukhala lazene kuti akufa siahyukichidwa. <verse eid="1CO 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 15:16" />Ikakhala zene wandhu akufa siahyukichidwa, ndekuti Kilisito nayo siwadahyukichidwe. <verse eid="1CO 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 15:17" />Ni ngati Kilisito siwada hyukichidwe, chikhulupi chanu nichachajhe, ni mkali mumachimo yanu. <verse eid="1CO 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 15:18" />Chimwecho ni onjhe anyiyao amwalila uku amkhulupila Kilisito atayika. <verse eid="1CO 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 15:19" />Ngati yajha tifuna kupata kuchoka kwa Kilisito ndande ya umoyo wathu wasazinope, ife ni wandhu tifunika kulengeledwa lisungu kupitilila wandhu onjhe pajhiko.<verse eid="1CO 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 15:20" />Nambho uzene Kilisito nde oyamba kuhyukichidwa ni Mnungu, kwa awajha amwalila ngati vipacho voyamba va mlimi. <verse eid="1CO 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 15:21" />Pakuti ngati mujha nyifa yapelekedwa pajhiko kupitila kwa mundhu mmojhi nde Adamu, chimwecho kuhyuka nako kwajha kupitila mundhu mmojhi nde Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 15:22" />Ngati mujha kwa kulunjana ni Adamu wandhu wonjhe amwalila, chinchijha wonjhe sahyukichidwe kwa kulunjana ni Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 15:23" />Nambho kila mmojhi siwahyuke kwa ndhawi yake, Kilisito wadali oyamba, nde sachatile anyiwajha ali wake ndhawi iyo siwajhe. <verse eid="1CO 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 15:24" />Pambuyo pa yameneyo, mathelo nde siyafike Kilisito yapo siwapache Amnungu Atate ufumu, pambuyo pa kutayila kutali kila mafumu, ulalilo ni mbhavu <verse eid="1CO 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 15:25" />Kilisito, wafunika walamulile, mbaka yapo Mnungu siwaike adani wake wonjhe panjhi pa ulamulilo wake. <verse eid="1CO 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 15:26" />Nyifa nde mdani wothela uyo siwayomwechedwe. <verse eid="1CO 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 15:27" />Malembo ya Mnungu yakamba, “Mnungu waika vindhu vonjhe panjhi pa ulamulilo wake.” Nambho malembo yapo yakamba, “Vindhu vonjhe vaikidwa panjhi pa ulamulilo wake dala wavilamule” Ili ni mate Mnungu siwalowa gulu limenelo la vindhu, mate iye nde waviika vindhu vimenevo panjhi pa Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 15:28" />Nambho vindhu vonjhe vikatho ikidwa panjhi pa ulamulilo wa Kilisito, nde yapo iye nayo Mwana siwajhiike panjhi pa ulamulilo wa Mnungu, uyo waika vonjhe panjhi pa ulamulilo wake, dala Mnungu walamulile vonjhe.<verse eid="1CO 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 15:29" />Ngati palibe kuhyuka, bwanji wandhu anyiyao abatizidwa ndande ya anyiyao amwalila, apenyelela kupata chiyani? Ngati yao amwalila siahyukichidwa, kubatizidwa ndande yao kuli ni mate yanji? <verse eid="1CO 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 15:30" />Niife ndande yanji tali muhatali ndhawi zonjhe? <verse eid="1CO 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 15:31" />Achabale, ine niichata nyifa siku zonjhe! Kwa ufulu nilinawo kwaanyiimwe pakulunjana ni Kililsito Yesu Mbuye wathu inichita niuzile chindhu ichi. <verse eid="1CO 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 15:32" />Ngati, dala langa lidakali la chimundhupe, kujha kubulana kwanga ni wandhu yao adali ngati zinyama zokalipa pano pa Efeso kudakanithangatila chiyani? Ngati yao amwalila siahyuka basi, “Tidye ni kumwa ndande mawa sitimwalile.”<verse eid="1CO 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 15:33" />Msadanyengeka, “Mabwenji woyipa uwananga ukhalo wako.” <verse eid="1CO 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 15:34" />Ukani yambani kukhala bwino, nisiyani kuchita machimo. Akumojhi wanu siamujhiwilatu Mnungu, ichi nikukambilani ninjhoni yaikulu kwanu.<verse eid="1CO 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thupi lo hyuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 15:35" />Nambho mundhu wakhoza kufunjha, “Yao amwalila siahyukichidwe bwanji? Siakhale ni thupi la bwanji?” <verse eid="1CO 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 15:36" />Anyiimwe asabwabwa! Ukavyala mbeu, ngati siifa ndekuti siimela. <verse eid="1CO 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 15:37" />Yapo muvyala, muvyala mbeupe, ikhozeka ya ngano mbeu kapina ina, ni osati mmela wambhumbhu uwo uchokela pambuyo <verse eid="1CO 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 15:38" />Nambho Mnungu wazipacha mbeu thupi, ngati mujha wafunila iye, kila mbeu zipheza thupi la lokha.<verse eid="1CO 15:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 15:39" />Mathupi ya voumbidwa vonjhe siyalingana, nambho matupi ya wandhu yamtundu umojhi, ni matupi ya zinyama niyamtundu umojhi, ni matupi ya mbalame niyamtundu umojhi, ni matupi ya njhomba niyamtundu umojhi.<verse eid="1CO 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 15:40" />Yalipo mathupi ya kumwamba ni yapajhiko, kukhadwa kwa matupi ya kumwamba nikwina, ni kukhadwa kwa matupi ya pajhiko nikwina. <verse eid="1CO 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CO 15:41" />Kukhadwa kwa jhua, kulekana ni kukhadwa kwa mwezi, ni kukhadwa kwa mwezi ulekana ni ndhondwa ata ndhondwa zene zileka kwa kukhadwa.<verse eid="1CO 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CO 15:42" />Chimwecho ndeumo siikhalile ndhawi ya kuhyukichidwa. Ngati ijha mbeu, thupi likwililidwa mndhaka ni liwanangika nambho lihyukichidwa lili lokhadwa. <verse eid="1CO 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CO 15:43" />Thupi lizikidwa lilibe mbhavu ni silikhadwa, nambho lihyukichidwa lililokhadwa, lijha thupi la vyalidwa popande mbhavu, lihyukichidwa kwa mbhavu. <verse eid="1CO 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CO 15:44" />Thupi yapo lizikidwa, likhala thupi la kawaida, yapo lihyukichidwa ni thupi la chizimu, ni kuli thupi lakawaida, ni thupi la chizimu. <verse eid="1CO 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CO 15:45" />Malembo yalembedwa, “Mundhu woyamba Adamu wadali choumbidwa chamoyo” Nambho Adamu wothela iye ni Mzimu uyo wapacha wandhu umoyo. <verse eid="1CO 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CO 15:46" />Nambho lichogolela kukhalako, opande thupi lijha la chizimu ila thupi la kawaida, ndiipo likujha thupi lijha la chizimu. <verse eid="1CO 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CO 15:47" />Mundhu woyamba yaani Adamu, wadaumbidwa kwa dothi, wadachoka mndhaka, mundhu wakawili yaani Kilisito wadachoka kumwamba. <verse eid="1CO 15:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CO 15:48" />Wonjhe ali ajhiko la panjhi ali ngati mundhu uyo wadaumbidwa kwa dothi, anyiwajha ali akumwamba ali ngati yujha wadachoka kumwamba. <verse eid="1CO 15:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CO 15:49" />Ngati mujha talingana ni yujha wadaumbidwa kwa dothi, chimwecho ndeumo sitilingane ni yujha wachoka kumwamba.<verse eid="1CO 15:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CO 15:50" />Achabale nikamba chimwechi, chijha chachitidwa kwa thupi ni mwazi sichikhoza kulunjana ni Ufumu wa Mnungu, niicho chiwanangika sichikhoza kukhala chosawanangike.<verse eid="1CO 15:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CO 15:51" />Vechelani nikukambilani chisisi ichi, ife sitimwalila taonjhe nambho taonjhe siting'anamulidwe,<verse eid="1CO 15:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CO 15:52" />Mwachizulumukila, ndhawi ya mbetete yothela yapo siilile, yao amwalila siahyukichidwe, nafe siting'anamulidwe ni kukhala ni matupi yayo siyakufanjho. <verse eid="1CO 15:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CO 15:53" />Mate thupi lowanangika, ifunika livale kosawanangika, ni dala thupi la kumwalila ifunika livale osamwalila. <verse eid="1CO 15:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CO 15:54" />Chimwecho thupi ili lakuwanangika yapo silivale kosawanangika, nalo thupi la kumwalila yapo sili vale kosamwalila, ndeyapo lijha mawu lalembedwa silikwanile “Nyifa yawanangidwa kwa kuikhoza!”<verse eid="1CO 15:54" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CO 15:55" />“Kuli pati kukhoza kwa nyifa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 15:55">Kuli pati kuwawa kwa nyifa?”<verse eid="1CO 15:55" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CO 15:56" />Nyifa, ipata mbhavu ya kupweteka kuchoka kumachimo, ni machimo yapata mbhavu ya kupweteka kuchoka mthauko. <verse eid="1CO 15:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CO 15:57" />Nambho wayamikidwe Mnungu, iye watipacha kukhoza kwa kupitila Yesu Kilisito!<verse eid="1CO 15:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CO 15:58" />Chimwecho achabale wanga, imani nganganga msada tingizika. Mpunde kuichita njhito ya Ambuye, mate mjhiwa njhito ya Ambuye siitaika chajhe.<verse eid="1CO 15:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CO 16" />
  <para style="s">Kwathangatila wandhu amkhulupila Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 16:1" />Chipano, nghani ya kuchocha njhembe ndande ya wandhu a Mnungu, chitani ngati umo nidaatumizila gulu la wandhu amkhulupilila Yesu aku Galatia. <verse eid="1CO 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 16:2" />Kila jumapili, kila mmojhi wanu wapatule ndalama ni kuzisunga, kuchokana ni kupata kwake, dala sikudakhala ni vuto la kuzipata ndalama za kunipacha. <verse eid="1CO 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 16:3" />Chimwecho yapo sinijhe kwanu, sinaatume anyiwajha simwasanghule pakati panu apeleke kalata ku Yelusalemu ni ndalama zijha mwasunga. <verse eid="1CO 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 16:4" />Ngati siifunike niine nipite, simkhale paulendo pamojhi ni ine.<verse eid="1CO 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Poolo waika mpango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 16:5" />Sinijhe kwanu pambuyo pakupitila ku Makedonia pakuti nifuna kupitila ku Makedonia. <verse eid="1CO 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 16:6" />Ikhozeka sinikhale kwanu kwa ndhawi kapina kukhala namwe nyengo yonjhe yo zizila, dala mukhoze kunithangatila pa ulendo wanga kwalikonjhe uko sinipite. <verse eid="1CO 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 16:7" />Sinikonda kupita kwanu msangamsanga nikuendekela ni ulendo, nifuna kukhala kwanu kwa masiku yambili, yapo Ambuye akanilola. <verse eid="1CO 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 16:8" />Nambho sinikhale pano pa Efeso mbaka ndhawi ya pwando la Pentekosite. <verse eid="1CO 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 16:9" />Mnungu wanipacha malo ya kuchita njhito yaikulu pano, nambho kuli ni wandhu ambili yao anichucha. <verse eid="1CO 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 16:10" />Nambho Timoseo wakajha, mtangatileni wakhale kwanu popande mandha, mate yake wachita njhito ya Ambuye chinchija ngati ine. <verse eid="1CO 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 16:11" />Ndiipo mundhu waliyonjhe wasada mdelela, nambho mmthangatileni kuti waende ulendo wake kwa mtendele, dala wajhe kwanga ndande ine nimlindilila pamojhi ni achabale wanga. <verse eid="1CO 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 16:12" />Nambho, kwa nghani za Apolo nampembelela kupunda wajhe kwanu pamojhi ni achabale, ingakhale siwamafune kujha chipano ila siwajhe wakapata malo.<verse eid="1CO 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mawu yomalizila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 16:13" />Khalani maso, imani nganganga muchikhulupi, msadaopa, ni mkhale ni mbhavu. <verse eid="1CO 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 16:14" />Chitani kilakandu kwa chikondi.<verse eid="1CO 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 16:15" />Mumjhiwa Sitefana ni wandhu amnyumba mwake, ndeyao adali oyamba kumkhulupila Kilisito ku Akaya, niajhichocha kwathangatila wandhu a Mnungu, namwenjho nikupembhani, <verse eid="1CO 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 16:16" />ifunika mwalemekeze wandhu ngati achameneo mchite chijha akukambilani, chimchijha alemekezeni wandhu anyiyawo achita nawo njhito.<verse eid="1CO 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 16:17" />Nikondwa kuti Sitefana, Fotunato ni Akaiko ajha, ndande anyiyawa anipacha yajha yadachepekela yapo simudalipo, <verse eid="1CO 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 16:18" />pakuti anikondwelecha mumtima mwanga, ngati umo adakukondwelechani anyiimwe, chimchijha ifunika kwakumbukila wandhu amtundu uwu.<verse eid="1CO 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 16:19" />Magulu ya wandhu amkhulupilila Kilisito a kumeneko ku Asia yakulonjelani, Akila ni Pulisila pamojhi ni gulu la wandhu amkhulupilila Kilisito ilo lili kukhomo kwao likulonjelani kupunda kwa kulunjana ni Ambuye. <verse eid="1CO 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 16:20" />Wandhu onjhe amkhulupilila Kilisito yawo alipano akulonjelani.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 16:20">Lonjelanani kulangiza kuti mulinimtendele.<verse eid="1CO 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 16:21" />Ine Poolo nilemba moni zanga kwa jhanja langa namwene.<verse eid="1CO 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 16:22" />Waliyonjhe uyo siwaakonda Ambuye walesedwe!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 16:22">Malanata mate yake, “Ambuye wathu majha!”<verse eid="1CO 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 16:23" />Napembha Ambuye Yesu aendekele kukuchilani vabwino.<verse eid="1CO 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 16:24" />Nikukondani mwaonjhe yawo mwalunjana ni Ambuye Yesu Kilisito.<verse eid="1CO 16:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 16" />
</usx>